{'symbol': 'JPM', 'date': '2023-03-08 09:30:00', 'title': 'J.P. MORGAN ASSET MANAGEMENT LAUNCHES J.P. MORGAN SMALL CAP VALUE ETF (JPSV) ON NYSE ARCA', 'text': 'FIRST J.P. MORGAN ETF UTILIZING NYSE ACTIVE PROXY MODEL NEW YORK , MARCH 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- J.P. MORGAN ASSET MANAGEMENT TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE JPMORGAN ACTIVE SMALL CAP VALUE ETF (JPSV), AN ACTIVELY MANAGED SMALL CAP ETF THAT SEEKS TO OUTPERFORM THE RUSSELL 2000 VALUE INDEX.'}